    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## Censys Supplier Risk Overview\nOverview dashboard for Censys Supplier Risk risk events. All panels count risk events in the selected **Time Range**, one per event id, and every filter applies to every panel. Open counts use the status that each event carries, so a risk opened earlier than the Time Range with no event inside it will not appear."
